  "description": "*PLEASE register your intention to attend the home open time by sending an enquiry. Without registration, we cannot notify you of any time changes or inspection cancellations.<br/><br/>*The APPLICATION will be provided when you send in an enquiry.<br/><br/>Positioned in a quiet cul-de-sac, this stylish and low-maintenance villa offers an exceptional lifestyle opportunity in one of Perth's most sought-after suburbs. Just a short stroll from the vibrant Oxford Street precinct, you'll enjoy easy access to an array of cafés, restaurants, boutique shopping, Luna Cinemas, The Good Grocer Leederville IGA, Leederville Train Station, and much more.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/> Master Bedroom: A comfortable and private retreat featuring a built-in robe, quality window treatments, floating flooring and plenty of natural light.<br/> Other Bedroom: Ideal as a guest room, home office, or additional bedroom, offering a built-in robe, window treatments, and floating flooring.<br/> Bathroom: Modern and well-appointed with full-height tiling, glass shower, vanity basin, and toilet (W/C).<br/> Living Area: The welcoming open-plan living space is bright and airy, featuring floating timber-look flooring, a ceiling fan for year-round comfort, and an expansive skylight that floods the home with natural light. This versatile area provides ample space for both relaxing and entertaining.<br/> Kitchen: The contemporary kitchen has been thoughtfully designed to combine style and functionality, featuring: Stone benchtops<br/>Stainless steel appliances and ample cupboard and storage space.<br/> Dining Area: Integrated seamlessly with the kitchen and living zone, the dining area creates a practical and sociable space for family meals or casual gatherings.<br/> Laundry: Convenient European-style laundry designed to maximise living space while providing practical functionality.<br/> Outdoor: The north-facing rear courtyard is a standout feature of the home, providing a private outdoor setting ideal for entertaining, relaxing, or enjoying the outdoors. Direct gated access to Brentham Reserve extends your living space and enhances the lifestyle appeal.<br/> Parking: Covered carport parking for one vehicle. Additional driveway parking for a second vehicle.<br/><br/><br/><br/>*Information Disclaimer: This information is solely for advertising and marketing purposes only. At the point of preparing the advertisement, it is believed to be accurate. Interested parties must undertake independent enquiries and investigations into any details herein that are true and correct. Information and figures may be subject to changes without prior notice.<br/>",
